// # ootty package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for ootty (layers/L3-tools).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (ootty.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of ootty.oo.
